  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h1> »genius« becomes a thread specialist </h1>",
   "body": "<p>Would you also like to measure inclined tools without contact, distortion-free and with μm accuracy?</p> <p>Expand your ZOLLER »genius« to »threadCheck«: Thanks to six CNC axes and the swiveling »orthoScan« multi-sensor optics carrier, you can measure all types of cutting tools automatically, quickly and with absolute precision.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3635\">ZOLLER thread measuring program</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/7/csm_gewinde_b8c99b9ec0.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
