    "h": 589
   },
   "title": "Thread measuring program",
   "text": "<p>For metric ISO, ANSI and Whitworth pipe threads</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3635",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Intelligent 24/7 presence </h2>",
   "body": "<p><strong>ZOLLER »roboSet 2« - automates your »genius«. Cleans, loads, labels and organizes your tools completely without manpower.</strong></p> <p><strong>All measurements are fully documented. After measurement, the tools are marked with ZOLLER »roboMark« - a laser flexibly marks the shank of the tool within milliseconds with values and other data individually determined during the measuring process.</strong></p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/in/products/automation/tool-inspection/roboset-2\">More about »roboSet 2«</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/d/csm_genius_roboSet2__preview_8b281c6989.webp",
